Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `Float` is a number type, not a function
  --> tests/ui/number_type_call_float_teaches_braces.jet:5:8
    |
  5 |     x: Float(n)
    |        ^^^^^
 Why: Jet builds a value of a number type with braces; parentheses call a function
 Fix: Write `Float{n}`
